        model_answer="The rating means that when the lamp is connected to 230 V it transfers 60 J of energy every second (its power is 60 W). The current is I = P ÷ V = 60 ÷ 230 ≈ 0.26 A. In 10 minutes (600 s) the energy transferred is E = P t = 60 × 600 = 36 000 J.",
